%I A398891 #7 Aug 24 2026 01:13:11
%S A398891 1,8,56,320,1832,8144,41600,156840,802516,2742884
%N A398891 Cluster series for site percolation on the square lattice with knight connected sites.
%C A398891 a(n) is the coefficient of p^(n+1) in the power series expansion of the expected finite size of the cluster containing a given site for percolation with probability p. If the given site is not open, its cluster is empty. Equivalently, a(n) can be taken to be the coefficient of p^n if we condition on the event that the given site is open.
%H A398891 <a href="/index/Cl#cluster">Index entries for sequences related to cluster series</a>.
%F A398891 a(n) = Sum_{m=1..n+1,k=max(A398889(m),n+1-m)..6*m+2} A398887(m,k)*m^2*(-1)^(n+1-m)*binomial(k,n+1-m).
%Y A398891 Cf. A003203, A018842, A030444, A398887, A398889, A398892, A398893.
%K A398891 nonn,more,new
%O A398891 0,2
